            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "OpenAI's new voice intelligence API targets customer service, education, and creator platforms",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "OpenAI has released new voice intelligence features for its API, enabling developers to build applications with advanced spoken-language understanding and generation capabilities across customer service, educational tools, and content creation platforms. The update lowers the barrier for businesses to deploy voice-first AI interfaces without building their own speech models. OpenAI says the features are designed for real-time, conversational use cases that go beyond simple transcription.",
